{
  "sections": {
    "main": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "\n<div class=\"ft-page\">\n  <div class=\"ft-page-head\">\n    <h1>Find your size</h1>\n    <p>Three answers and we&rsquo;ll tell you what most people your shape end up keeping.\n    No account, no measuring tape required.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ft-fit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"ft-fit-controls\">\n      <label class=\"ft-fit-row\">\n        <span class=\"ft-fit-label\">01 &mdash; Height</span>\n        <output id=\"ftH\">5&prime; 10&Prime;</output>\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"ftHeight\" min=\"56\" max=\"80\" value=\"70\">\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"ft-fit-row\">\n        <span class=\"ft-fit-label\">02 &mdash; Weight</span>\n        <output id=\"ftW\">175 lb</output>\n        <input type=\"range\" id=\"ftWeight\" min=\"90\" max=\"330\" value=\"175\">\n      </label>\n      <div class=\"ft-fit-row\">\n        <span class=\"ft-fit-label\">03 &mdash; How do you like a tee to sit?</span>\n        <div class=\"ft-seg\" id=\"ftFit\">\n          <button type=\"button\" data-v=\"-1\">Close</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-v=\"0\" class=\"is-on\">True to size</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-v=\"1\">Roomy</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <aside class=\"ft-fit-result\">\n      <span class=\"ft-eyebrow ft-eyebrow--light\">We&rsquo;d put you in</span>\n      <div class=\"ft-fit-size\" id=\"ftSize\">L</div>\n      <p>This is where most people your build land, and stay after a wash or two.</p>\n      <dl class=\"ft-fit-meta\">\n        <div><dt>Chest, laid flat</dt><dd id=\"ftChest\">22&Prime;</dd></div>\n        <div><dt>Body length</dt><dd id=\"ftLen\">30&Prime;</dd></div>\n      </dl>\n      <a class=\"ft-btn ft-btn--light\" id=\"ftShop\" href=\"/collections/faith\">Shop L</a>\n    </aside>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"ft-h2\">Measurements, in inches</h2>\n  <p class=\"ft-tablenote\">Garment, laid flat &mdash; unisex tee (Bella+Canvas 3001)</p>\n  <div class=\"ft-tablewrap\">\n    <table class=\"ft-table\">\n      <thead><tr><th>Size</th><th>Chest</th><th>Length</th><th>Shoulder</th><th>Sleeve</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>XS</td><td>16.5</td><td>27</td><td>15.5</td><td>7.6</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>S</td><td>18</td><td>28</td><td>16.5</td><td>7.9</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>M</td><td>20</td><td>29</td><td>18</td><td>8.3</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>L</td><td>22</td><td>30</td><td>19.5</td><td>8.7</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>XL</td><td>24</td><td>31</td><td>21</td><td>9.1</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>2XL</td><td>26</td><td>32</td><td>22.5</td><td>9.4</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ft-tips\">\n    <div class=\"ft-tip\"><h3>Between sizes?</h3><p>Take the smaller one. The body is cut generously and drops about half an inch after the first wash.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"ft-tip\"><h3>Women&rsquo;s cut</h3><p>Our women&rsquo;s tee (6400) is shaped through the waist and about an inch shorter. Same chest measurements otherwise.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"ft-tip\"><h3>Church size runs</h3><p>For 40 people, a good default is 4&nbsp;S, 12&nbsp;M, 14&nbsp;L, 8&nbsp;XL, 2&nbsp;2XL. <a href=\"/pages/for-churches\">Use the run picker</a>.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var H=document.getElementById('ftHeight'),W=document.getElementById('ftWeight'),\n      hOut=document.getElementById('ftH'),wOut=document.getElementById('ftW'),\n      sizeEl=document.getElementById('ftSize'),chestEl=document.getElementById('ftChest'),\n      lenEl=document.getElementById('ftLen'),shopEl=document.getElementById('ftShop'),\n      seg=document.getElementById('ftFit');\n  if(!H) return;\n  var SIZES=['XS','S','M','L','XL','2XL'];\n  var SPEC={XS:[16.5,27],S:[18,28],M:[20,29],L:[22,30],XL:[24,31],'2XL':[26,32]};\n  var pref=0;\n\n  function calc(){\n    var h=+H.value, w=+W.value;\n    // Body-mass driven, height nudges the band. Tuned to Bella 3001 fit.\n    var bmi = (w*703)/(h*h);\n    var i = bmi<19?1 : bmi<23?2 : bmi<27?3 : bmi<31?4 : 5;\n    if(h>=74 && i<5) i++;            // very tall: length rules\n    if(h<=64 && i>0) i--;            // very short: drop a band\n    i = Math.max(0, Math.min(5, i+pref));\n    var s=SIZES[i];\n    sizeEl.textContent=s;\n    chestEl.innerHTML=SPEC[s][0]+'&Prime;';\n    lenEl.innerHTML=SPEC[s][1]+'&Prime;';\n    shopEl.textContent='Shop '+s;\n    var ft=Math.floor(h/12), inch=h%12;\n    hOut.innerHTML=ft+'&prime; '+inch+'&Prime;';\n    wOut.textContent=w+' lb';\n  }\n  H.addEventListener('input',calc); W.addEventListener('input',calc);\n  seg.addEventListener('click',function(e){\n    var b=e.target.closest('button'); if(!b) return;\n    [].forEach.call(seg.children,function(c){c.classList.remove('is-on');});\n    b.classList.add('is-on'); pref=+b.dataset.v; calc();\n  });\n  calc();\n})();\n</script>\n",
        "padding-block-start": 0,
        "padding-block-end": 0
      }
    }
  },
  "order": [
    "main"
  ]
}